      "blockId": "paragraph:discussion:0008",
      "type": "sentence",
      "source": "If the [`IKCameraDeviceView`](ikcameradeviceview.md) [`transferMode`](ikcameradeviceview/transfermode.md) property is [`IKCameraDeviceViewTransferMode.fileBased`](ikcameradeviceviewtransfermode/filebased.md) then camera file will have been saved to `url`.",
      "normalizedSource": "If the [`IKCameraDeviceView`](ikcameradeviceview.md) [`transferMode`](ikcameradeviceview/transfermode.md) property is [`IKCameraDeviceViewTransferMode.fileBased`](ikcameradeviceviewtransfermode/filebased.md) then camera file will have been saved to `url`.",
      "sourceHash": "4f3f4f8173b67266079bccae0ecad4b9940faf10c929fc49fc6f3ab5ea445493",
      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "The URL will be a complete path to save the file, including a ‘sequence number’ if the file already exists.",
