      "source": "If the [`transferMode`](ikcameradeviceview/transfermode.md) is [`IKCameraDeviceViewTransferMode.memoryBased`](ikcameradeviceviewtransfermode/memorybased.md) then the `data` parameter contains the image data and can be handled as appropriate for your application.",
      "normalizedSource": "If the [`transferMode`](ikcameradeviceview/transfermode.md) is [`IKCameraDeviceViewTransferMode.memoryBased`](ikcameradeviceviewtransfermode/memorybased.md) then the `data` parameter contains the image data and can be handled as appropriate for your application.",
